      en: ["Administrative capital of Thaa Atoll", "Geographic distance of 225 km from Malé", "Total island area is approximately 29 hectares", "Population stands at around 1,050 residents", "Significant center for yellowfin tuna fishing", "Harbor expansion project completed in 2014"],
